      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"infestation\" is a scary word to use for a website haha. but i get what you mean. it feels like once one of these tiny glitches starts, more of them just follow. like they're part of some little group or something. if i find one of these \"sneaky little bugs\" doing something it shouldn't, how do i know if it's just a one-off error or if there's a whole bunch of them hiding in the corners of my database waiting to cause more trouble?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
